# Drop tray.png (16x16 or 24x24 PNG) and tray.ico (multi-size .ico) here
# before running `npm run package`. The PNG is what Electron uses for the
# in-app tray; the .ico is what NSIS uses for the Start menu / installer.
#
# Until they exist, the tray falls back to a transparent placeholder image
# (so the app still runs in dev) and electron-builder refuses to package.
